<Mod id="10f6101f-0b22-4c8d-9454-97a94ff8150d" version="1">
  <Properties>
    <Name>UI - Overlay Harbours And Airports</Name>
    <Teaser>Adds a Harbours and Airports entry in the Overlay menu in strategic view that highlights all cities with a harbour or airport</Teaser>
    <Description>Adds a Harbours and Airports entry in the Overlay menu in strategic view that highlights all cities with a harbour or airport

Hooks into the MiniMap Panel Overlay drop-down via the "Utils - Modular MiniMap Overlays" mod</Description>
    <Authors>William Howard</Authors>
    <HideSetupGame>0</HideSetupGame>
